Subject: [PATCH] wip(p1): T8 prototype of relaxed CFR terminal kernels and f32
 regret matching

Environment-selected variants (SOLVERS_P1_KERNEL=exact|f64fold|f32,
SOLVERS_P1_NORM=exact|f32) apply only to the CFR pass; evaluation, average
strategy and saved EVs keep the exact kernels. Unset means exact.
Measurement-only prototype pending a user decision.

